== every API error, split on the error alone (REQ-STOP-02) ==
rate_limit               {"class":"rate_limit","action":"wait","retry":"interval","notify":"2h","hold":true}
billing_error            {"class":"billing_error","action":"wait","retry":"interval","notify":"now","hold":true}
overloaded               {"class":"transient","action":"wait","retry":"interval","notify":"1h","hold":false}
server_error             {"class":"transient","action":"wait","retry":"interval","notify":"1h","hold":false}
max_output_tokens        {"class":"transient","action":"wait","retry":"at-once","notify":"1h","hold":false}
invalid_request          {"class":"invalid_request","action":"redispatch","retry":"none","notify":"no","hold":false}
model_not_found          {"class":"model_not_found","action":"escalate","retry":"none","notify":"now","hold":false}
authentication_failed    {"class":"unrecoverable","action":"wait","retry":"interval","notify":"now","hold":false}
oauth_org_not_allowed    {"class":"unrecoverable","action":"wait","retry":"interval","notify":"now","hold":false}
account_on_hold          {"class":"unrecoverable","action":"wait","retry":"interval","notify":"now","hold":false}
cloud_credential_error   {"class":"unrecoverable","action":"wait","retry":"interval","notify":"now","hold":false}
unknown                  {"class":"unrecoverable","action":"wait","retry":"interval","notify":"now","hold":false}
a_value_a_later_cli_adds {"class":"unrecoverable","action":"wait","retry":"interval","notify":"now","hold":false}
== the declared stops (REQ-STOP-12) ==
no-handover              {"class":"no-handover","action":"ladder","retry":"ladder","notify":"at-escalation","hold":false}
unfinished               {"class":"unfinished","action":"redispatch","retry":"none","notify":"at-second","hold":false}
blocked                  {"class":"blocked","action":"blocker","retry":"none","notify":"when-distant","hold":false}
merge-failed             {"class":"merge-failed","action":"escalate","retry":"none","notify":"now","hold":false}
main-broken              {"class":"main-broken","action":"park-project","retry":"none","notify":"now","hold":false}
other                    {"class":"other","action":"escalate","retry":"none","notify":"now","hold":false}
== the two outcomes that are not stops ==
complete                 {"class":"complete","action":"dispatch","retry":"none","notify":"no","hold":false}
asking                   {"class":"asking","action":"escalate","retry":"none","notify":"now","hold":false}
== the ceilings, in seconds; -1 is a notify bit that is not a ceiling ==
now                      0
1h                       3600
2h                       7200
at-escalation            -1
when-distant             -1
no                       -1
